### .easignore -- files EAS should NOT bundle into the project archive.
### See https://docs.expo.dev/build-reference/easignore/
###
### Each pattern uses leading ``/`` where applicable so the rules
### apply regardless of how ``eas-cli`` walks the project root.
### Without leading slashes, a pattern like ``node_modules`` has
### occasionally been ignored on older versions of eas-cli, so we
### list both anchored and unanchored forms.

### --- Dependencies -------------------------------------------------
### EAS runs ``npm install`` on the build server, so uploading these
### eats hundreds of MB for nothing.
/node_modules/
/**/node_modules/
node_modules/
.npm/
.npm-cache/
.pnp.*

### --- Lockfiles / logs the build server regenerates itself --------
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
yarn-error.log*
yarn-debug.log*
npm-debug.log*

### --- Build outputs ----------------------------------------------
### Produced fresh on the build server; previous outputs have no
### value and may cause confusion if shipped.
/dist/
/.web-build/
/.expo/
/.expo-shared/
/.expo.cache/
.metro-cache/
.metro-health-check*
.bundle/
.expo-router/
*.tsbuildinfo
*.log

### --- Android local builds ---------------------------------------
/android/.gradle/
/android/build/
/android/app/build/
/android/app/release/
/android/app/debug/
/android/local.properties
/android/keystores/

### --- iOS local builds -------------------------------------------
/ios/Pods/
/ios/build/
/ios/.xcode.env.local
/ios/DerivedData/

### --- Tests, docs, editor noise -----------------------------------
/coverage/
/.vscode/
/.idea/
CHANGELOG*.md
HISTORY.md
*.lcov
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo

### --- CI / GitHub / GitLab / Circle metadata -----------------------
/.github/
/.gitlab-ci.yml
/.circleci/
